"pharo-image-fixes.st -- GENERATED by scripts/gen-image-fixes.py from
scripts/image-fixes/*.st.  Do not edit this file: edit the source files and run
the generator.

Fixes for defects in the Pharo 13 and Pharo 14 images and their tests.  File
this in when an image is prepared for a test run (after setup_fake_gui.st), on
our VM and on stock Cog.  Every entry has a guard on the defect in the current
source, so the file is correct for the two Pharo versions and for an image
where upstream repaired the defect.  Each entry prints one line: FIXED, ADDED
or SKIP with the reason.  The list of defects is in docs/image_issues.md."!

